{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d23241e2-a9b8-873a-8b60-aa690fb78ed1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:31:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Marisa Brito. I'll give you the bottom line first. I need to know what license is required for a food truck down at the waterfront."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is this a truck you're planning to start up, or one that's already running somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's for my mother. She's the one who wants to do it, but she's not comfortable on the phone, so I'm calling for her. We're at 172 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. So for a mobile food vendor, there's a license through our office, and then the health side usually has its own sign-off on the truck. Where at the waterfront are you thinking, a city-owned spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somewhere along the harbor, where people walk. I don't have the exact spot yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That matters, because some locations have extra rules or aren't open to vending at all. I'd want to confirm the location before anybody pays for anything. I can have the licensing staff go over the application and the location rules with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And how long is the license good for once she gets it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally those are issued for a set term and then renewed, often on a yearly basis. I'd rather you hear the exact dates from the licensing staff when you get the application, since it can depend on the type of license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Can you mail the application, or do we come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can come by City Hall, or I can have it sent. Mailing is easy. I just need your mailing address, which I think you already gave me. Gibbs Avenue, one seventy-two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And if you need to call back, the number is 401-555-0185. I'm happy to speak slowly if it helps you get it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, I've got it, thank you. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-five. I'll put a note on the request, and somebody will be in touch if there's anything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So the application comes in the mail, and the location has to be checked first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Check the location, then submit the application with whatever the health side requires."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Rosa. That's what I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good rest of your day."
    }
  ],
